  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- ForceMethodParametersInvocationsDiagnosticsAnalyzer now checks that the forced argument's parameter type is actually supplied (JsonSerializerOptions for Serialize, SerializeAsync, Deserialize and DeserializeAsync; Int32 for NSubstitute Received), fixing a self-comparison bug that let calls such as JsonSerializer.Serialize(obj, typeof(T)) pass (#461)\n- All analyzers: GeneratedCodeAnalysisFlags.None replaced with ReportDiagnostics so diagnostics are reported on generated code\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated Nullable.Extended.Analyzer to 1.19.0\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test to 6.4.7.2960\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.Test.Source.Generator to 6.4.7.2960\n- Perf: use cached INamedTypeSymbol comparisons instead of formatted-string comparisons in analyzers\n- Perf: commonize duplicated helper-shaped code across analyzers (#459)\n- Perf: micro-optimizations and allocation trims in analyzers (#460)\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Enumeration to 1.2.156.2472\n- Dependencies - Updated Meziantou.Analyzer to 3.0.318",
